This exception does not permit selling, sublicensing for a fee, renting,
monetizing, commercially distributing, or commercially bundling Sprig or a
Derivative; incorporating it into a product supplied to customers; offering
its functionality as an external commercial or hosted service; or providing
paid Sprig-specific hosting, customization, distribution, or support.
